OL,3,ABody of newborn baby found on shoreline
OL,4,Ain Wales as police search for mother
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe body of a newborn baby has been
OL,7,Ffound along a shoreline in north Wales.
OL,9,FNorth Wales Police have appealed for
OL,10,Fthe mother who may be "extremely
OL,11,Fvulnerable" to come forward.
OL,13,FA member of the public found the body
OL,14,Fon the Menai Strait shoreline near
OL,15,FSiliwen Road on Sunday shortly before
OL,16,F17:00 BST.
OL,18,FDuring a press conference, Director of
OL,19,FMidwifery and Women's Services for
OL,20,FBetsi Cadwaladr health board Fiona
OL,21,FGiraud has appealed directly to the
OL,22,Fmother to come forward.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
